    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Pane Puzzle</i> challenges you in restoring pictures by means of stacking up colored tiles. Rotate and reflect each tile to fit, but be aware you can only use each one once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers <strong>100 different puzzles</strong> and <strong>20 tiles to master</strong>, ensuring that interesting challenges never run out. Puzzle enthusiasts looking for a calm yet stimulating experience will love the tranquil soundtrack, which adds to the relaxing atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 unique puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 colorful tiles to manipulate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, tranquil soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to solve the intricate tile puzzles of <i>The Pane Puzzle</i>?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Pane Puzzle</i> challenges you in restoring pictures by means of stacking up colored tiles. Rotate and reflect each tile to fit, but be aware you can only use each one once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers <strong>100 different puzzles</strong> and <strong>20 tiles to master</strong>, ensuring that interesting challenges never run out. Puzzle enthusiasts looking for a calm yet stimulating experience will love the tranquil soundtrack, which adds to the relaxing atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 unique puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 colorful tiles to manipulate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, tranquil soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to solve the intricate tile puzzles of <i>The Pane Puzzle</i>?</p>",
